WEBVTT

00:00:00.264 --> 00:00:05.138
The Ops Console is for operators.

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:12.710
Open /ops and enter OPS_TOKEN.

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:17.718
System: instance, uptime, memory and CPU, updated live.

00:00:17.718 --> 00:00:20.985
Env: every environment variable, with values masked.

00:00:20.985 --> 00:00:25.356
Filter by name.

00:00:25.356 --> 00:00:28.667
Refresh re-reads the process environment.

00:00:29.491 --> 00:00:42.930
Safe to expose to operators.
